WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.540 --> 00:00:04.930
- Congratulations on completing

00:00:04.930 --> 00:00:07.180
Khan for Educators initial course.

00:00:07.180 --> 00:00:09.330
Your efforts to grow your
professional learning

00:00:09.330 --> 00:00:12.070
inspire all of us at Khan Academy.

00:00:12.070 --> 00:00:13.970
While this course has come to an end,

00:00:13.970 --> 00:00:16.630
Khan Academy offers other
communication channels

00:00:16.630 --> 00:00:19.130
and opportunities to keep learning.

00:00:19.130 --> 00:00:22.413
From the Teacher dashboard,
click on the Resources tab.

00:00:23.280 --> 00:00:25.650
Here you will find additional materials

00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:28.883
that may help you use Khan
Academy with your students.

00:00:31.420 --> 00:00:33.290
Also, check out the Help Center

00:00:33.290 --> 00:00:35.050
where you can find a series of articles

00:00:35.050 --> 00:00:36.760
including frequently asked questions

00:00:36.760 --> 00:00:40.133
and guides for students,
teachers and parents.

00:00:41.380 --> 00:00:43.100
In addition, from the Help Center,

00:00:43.100 --> 00:00:44.770
you can report a technical problem

00:00:44.770 --> 00:00:47.123
and receive assistance
from our support team.

00:00:49.550 --> 00:00:52.350
To learn more about Khan
Academy's training initiatives

00:00:52.350 --> 00:00:55.260
or other projects, keep
an eye on your inbox.

00:00:55.260 --> 00:00:56.560
We'll always make an effort

00:00:56.560 --> 00:00:59.120
to keep our educators in the know.

00:00:59.120 --> 00:01:02.183
You can also follow our
teacher-exclusive Facebook group,

00:01:03.260 --> 00:01:05.060
and Teach With Khan Twitter account.

00:01:06.530 --> 00:01:08.770
For additional teacher-focused videos,

00:01:08.770 --> 00:01:11.020
like interviews with
our teacher ambassadors

00:01:11.020 --> 00:01:12.470
or past webinars,

00:01:12.470 --> 00:01:15.770
visit our Khan Academy
Teacher YouTube channel.

00:01:15.770 --> 00:01:18.060
Or for more on remote
teaching and learning,

00:01:18.060 --> 00:01:20.000
check out our Keep everyone learning site

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:23.360
for resources for students,
teachers and families,

00:01:23.360 --> 00:01:25.970
available in English and Spanish.

00:01:25.970 --> 00:01:27.290
Finally, if you'd be willing

00:01:27.290 --> 00:01:29.460
to share a few moments of your time,

00:01:29.460 --> 00:01:31.670
we'd love to get your
feedback on this course

00:01:31.670 --> 00:01:35.040
and how we can best support
teachers everywhere.

00:01:35.040 --> 00:01:37.190
If you'd be willing to provide feedback,

00:01:37.190 --> 00:01:40.250
please use the survey
found in this lesson.

00:01:40.250 --> 00:01:43.010
If you have any difficulties
accessing the survey,

00:01:43.010 --> 00:01:47.003
please contact
teachereducation@khanacademy.org.

00:01:47.940 --> 00:01:50.090
Once again, congratulations on completing

00:01:50.090 --> 00:01:52.570
Khan for Educators initial course.

00:01:52.570 --> 00:01:54.230
We look forward to hearing more about

00:01:54.230 --> 00:01:56.980
the incredible things you
are doing with your students.

